    <!-- MAIN -->
    <main class="main-content">

        <div class="intro-card">
            <div class="intro-card-icon">📜</div>
            <p>
                <strong>Summary:</strong> Scoutix is operated by <strong>Muhammad Mohsin Shabbir</strong>, a sole proprietor based in Islamabad, Pakistan. The platform surfaces publicly available business data for legitimate B2B use only. Do not use it for spam, to resell raw data, or for any illegal purpose. Subscriptions auto-renew until cancelled. A 14-day money-back guarantee applies to first-time subscribers. These Terms are governed by the laws of Pakistan.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- ─── 01 ─── -->
        <section class="policy-section" id="parties">
            <div class="section-number">Section 01</div>
            <h2>Parties &amp; Identification</h2>
            <p>These Terms of Service ("Terms") constitute a legally binding agreement between you ("User," "Subscriber," or "you") and the individual operating the Scoutix platform under the following details:</p>
            <div class="info-box">
                <strong>Service Operator:</strong> Muhammad Mohsin Shabbir<br>
                <strong>Trading as:</strong> Scoutix<br>
                <strong>Operating as:</strong> Sole proprietor — no registered company entity at this time<br>
                <strong>Location:</strong> Islamabad, Islamic Republic of Pakistan<br>
                <strong>Contact:</strong> support@scoutix.io
            </div>
            <p>All references to "Scoutix," "we," "us," or "our" throughout these Terms refer to Muhammad Mohsin Shabbir trading as Scoutix. As a sole proprietor, Muhammad Mohsin Shabbir is personally responsible for the operation of the Service and the obligations described herein.</p>
            <p>By creating an account, completing the subscription checkout, or otherwise accessing or using the Service, you confirm that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms and the Scoutix Privacy Policy, which is incorporated herein by reference.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- ─── 02 ─── -->
        <section class="policy-section" id="description">
            <div class="section-number">Section 02</div>
            <h2>Description of Service</h2>
            <p>Scoutix is a paid B2B Software-as-a-Service (SaaS) platform that provides lead generation tools for businesses. The core functionality enables users to search, filter, and export publicly available business information — including business names, addresses, phone numbers, websites, categories, ratings, and operational details — aggregated from publicly accessible online sources.</p>
            <p>Additional features may include contact organization, lead management, bulk data export, and related tools designed to support legitimate business development and outreach. The Service is available exclusively as a paid subscription and is accessed via the Scoutix web application.</p>
            <p>Scoutix is a tool to assist users in locating and organizing publicly available business contact information. It is not a database of private individual data. It does not guarantee the accuracy, currency, or completeness of the information it surfaces.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- ─── 03 ─── -->
        <section class="policy-section" id="eligibility">
            <div class="section-number">Section 03</div>
            <h2>Eligibility</h2>
            <p>To access and use Scoutix, you must: (a) be at least <strong>18 years of age</strong>; (b) have the full legal capacity to enter into a binding agreement under the laws of your jurisdiction; (c) use the Service exclusively for lawful business purposes; (d) not be located in a jurisdiction where access to or use of the Service is prohibited by applicable law; and (e) maintain a valid active paid subscription.</p>
            <p>By registering an account, you represent and warrant that you meet all eligibility requirements stated above. Scoutix reserves the right to verify eligibility at any time and to suspend or terminate accounts that do not qualify.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- ─── 04 ─── -->
        <section class="policy-section" id="account">
            <div class="section-number">Section 04</div>
            <h2>Account Responsibility</h2>
            <p>You are solely responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. All activity occurring under your account — whether authorized by you or not — is your responsibility.</p>
            <p>You agree to: (a) provide accurate, current, and complete information at registration; (b) promptly update your account information if it changes; (c) notify Scoutix immediately at support@scoutix.io if you suspect unauthorized access to your account; and (d) never share your login credentials with any third party.</p>
            <p>Each subscription covers a single user unless your plan explicitly states otherwise. Accounts may not be shared, transferred, sold, or accessed concurrently by multiple individuals. Scoutix reserves the right to terminate accounts found to be in violation of this restriction.</p>
            <p><strong>Electronic Communications Consent:</strong> By creating an account, you consent to receiving electronic communications from Scoutix relating to your account, billing, subscription status, and service updates. These communications form part of your contractual relationship with us and may be sent to the email address you provided at registration.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- ─── 05 ─── -->
        <section class="policy-section" id="acceptable-use">
            <div class="section-number">Section 05</div>
            <h2>Acceptable Use Policy</h2>
            <p>You agree to use Scoutix only for lawful purposes and strictly in accordance with these Terms. The following clarifies permitted and prohibited activities:</p>
            <div class="terms-grid">
                <div class="term-card allowed">
                    <h4>✅ Permitted Uses</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Searching for publicly available business information</li>
                        <li>Exporting business leads for your own lawful outreach</li>
                        <li>Building prospect lists for legitimate sales campaigns</li>
                        <li>Using exported data for lawful B2B marketing</li>
                        <li>Organizing and managing your lead pipeline</li>
                        <li>Legitimate business development activities</li>
                        <li>Complying with all applicable anti-spam and marketing laws</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
                <div class="term-card prohibited">
                    <h4>🚫 Prohibited Uses</h4>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Sending unsolicited bulk email (spam)</li>
                        <li>Harassing, stalking, or unlawfully contacting individuals</li>
                        <li>Reselling or redistributing raw exported data</li>
                        <li>Sharing or transferring account access</li>
                        <li>Circumventing usage limits, quotas, or billing</li>
                        <li>Any illegal purpose whatsoever</li>
                        <li>Uploading or transmitting malware or malicious code</li>
                        <li>Reverse-engineering, decompiling, or copying our software</li>
                        <li>Violating data protection, anti-spam, or telemarketing laws</li>
                        <li>Automated access beyond permitted platform use</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
            <p>Violation of this Acceptable Use Policy may result in immediate account suspension or termination without refund. Scoutix reserves the right to report illegal activity to relevant authorities in Pakistan or any applicable jurisdiction.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- ─── 06 ─── -->
        <section class="policy-section" id="data-restrictions">
            <div class="section-number">Section 06</div>
            <h2>Data Use Restrictions</h2>
            <p>Business data accessible through Scoutix is aggregated from publicly available online sources and provided to you solely for your own internal business use. You expressly agree that you will not:</p>
            <p>(a) <strong>Resell raw data:</strong> You may not resell, license, sublicense, distribute, or otherwise commercialize raw exported data to any third party — in original or modified form — without prior written consent from Scoutix.</p>
            <p>(b) <strong>Build competing products:</strong> You may not use data or platform access to build, train, populate, or support a competing lead generation database, product, or service, or to create any derivative dataset for commercial distribution.</p>
            <p>(c) <strong>Unlawful use:</strong> You may not use exported data in any manner that violates applicable law, including sending unsolicited commercial messages, engaging in unlawful telemarketing, or targeting individuals in violation of applicable privacy or data protection law.</p>
            <div class="highlight-box">
                ℹ️ The Service is intended to surface business contact information. Some data may relate to sole proprietors or individuals acting in a business capacity. Users remain solely responsible for verifying data accuracy and ensuring legal compliance before conducting any outreach or marketing activity.
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ─── 07 ─── -->
        <section class="policy-section" id="user-compliance">
            <div class="section-number">Section 07</div>
            <h2>User Compliance Responsibility — No Guarantee by Scoutix</h2>
            <p><strong>Scoutix makes no representation, warranty, or guarantee that your use of the platform or any data obtained through it is compliant with the laws, regulations, or third-party platform policies applicable in your jurisdiction or in the jurisdictions you target.</strong></p>
            <p>It is your sole responsibility to:</p>
            <p>(a) determine the lawful basis under which you may contact businesses using data exported from the platform in each jurisdiction you operate in;</p>
            <p>(b) comply with all applicable laws and regulations — including without limitation CAN-SPAM, CASL, GDPR, PECR, and any equivalent anti-spam, telemarketing, and data protection laws applicable to your activities;</p>
            <p>(c) obtain any required consents or authorizations before initiating outreach using exported data; and</p>
            <p>(d) ensure your use of the data does not violate the terms of service of any third-party platform from which data may have been aggregated.</p>
            <div class="warning-box">
                ⚠️ Scoutix expressly disclaims all liability for any regulatory fines, penalties, legal claims, or enforcement actions brought against you as a result of your use of exported data. By subscribing, you accept full and sole responsibility for your outreach and marketing activities.
            </div>
            <p><strong>No Agency:</strong> Scoutix does not act as your agent, data processor, marketing intermediary, or co-sender in connection with any outreach, email campaigns, or commercial communications you conduct using data obtained through the platform. Any such activities are undertaken by you independently and solely on your own behalf.</p>
        </section>

        <!-- ─── 08 ─── -->
        <section class="policy-section" id="subscription">
            <div class="section-number">Section 08</div>
            <h2>Subscription &amp; Billing</h2>
            <h3>Subscription Plans</h3>
            <p>Scoutix is offered as a monthly subscription service. Current plans are as follows:</p>
            <table class="plan-table">
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>Plan</th>
                        <th>Monthly Price (USD)</th>
                        <th>Auto-Renewal</th>
                        <th>Cancel Anytime</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Starter</td>
                        <td>$39 / month</td>
                        <td><span class="badge-green">Yes</span></td>
                        <td><span class="badge-green">Yes</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Growth</td>
                        <td>$69 / month</td>
                        <td><span class="badge-green">Yes</span></td>
                        <td><span class="badge-green">Yes</span></td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                        <td>Pro</td>
                        <td>$149 / month</td>
                        <td><span class="badge-green">Yes</span></td>
                        <td><span class="badge-green">Yes</span></td>
                    </tr>
                </tbody>
            </table>

            <h3>Payment Processing — Paddle</h3>
